l-transcripts/2019/08/01/bce-inc-bce-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George Cope","x":"We did do a cost restructuring last year at the end of the fourth quarter, and that was across the entire organization, and we're really trying to be as careful as we can with the cost of upgrades, et cetera through the cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/bce-inc-bce-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2019-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"Subscriber revenue increased 7% year-over-year the result of significant growth in Crave customer subscriptions over the past year and the flow-through of higher rates for our enhanced Crave streaming service launched last November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/bce-inc-bce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2019-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Casey","x":"…acceleration of cord cutting in the U.S. and you're obviously well positioned for that given that variety of products you have but I'm just wondering how you're thinking in expectations on cord cutting are evolving as we get a number of streaming options coming online over the next sort of while.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/bce-inc-bce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"Total BCE revenue was up 1.8% year-over-year which together with the favorable impact of IFRS 16 accounting and cost savings delivered a healthy 5.6% increase in adjusted EBITDA and a 1.5% increase in margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/bce-inc-bce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"That benefited from both the positive impact of IFRS 16 and programming cost savings as last year's results included the broadcast -- the sports broadcast as I mentioned of the FIFA World Cup.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/bce-inc-bce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"As I've said I'll reiterate guidance for all of our metrics 7% to 12% of free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/bce-inc-bce-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q4","e":"bce","d":"2020-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"At Bell Media our market leading brands, content, and streaming services together with a sharp focus on cost control delivered strong financial performance in 2019 with cash flow growth that we redirected to capital investment in our broadband networks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/bce-inc-bce-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q4","e":"bce","d":"2020-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"And just last week, we were proud to expand Crave to include French language content and we made our Super Ecran service available direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/bce-inc-bce-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2019 Q4","e":"bce","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"…growth is a strong contribution from Bell Wireless, where we will continue to balance subscriber growth with profitability, positive residential wireline financial profile and improving year-over-year rate of EBITDA decline in our Bell business markets unit and ongoing focus on cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/bce-inc-bce-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q1","e":"bce","d":"2020-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"This is also why we have delayed implementation of previously planned price increases for home phone and certain TV services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/bce-inc-bce-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q1","e":"bce","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"…at the end of this, as I mentioned in an earlier -- in response to an earlier question, we're going to see in the medium-term some cost savings goodness just from an accelerated footprint deployment, which we're continuing to engage on or embark on throughout 2020 and as we had initially planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/bce-inc-bce-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q1","e":"bce","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"Although difficult to assess with any pinpoint accuracy, we estimate that our normalized -- that normalizing for COVID, our overall consolidated results for Q1 were tracking to our now withdrawn guidance targets for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/bce-inc-bce-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"Virgin TV is an app-based TV service that does not require a traditional set-top box or install and works on virtually all streaming devices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bce-inc-bce-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"Our latest TV innovation just announced on Tuesday is the Bell Streamer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bce-inc-bce-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2020-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"Crave also continued to deliver with strong direct-to-consumer growth as total subscribers increased to $2.8 million at the end of June, which is up from $2.7 million in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bce-inc-bce-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glen LeBlanc","x":"…year-over-year at approximately 30% due to expense reductions driven by programming, production cost savings, the elimination of discretionary costs and amounts received under the federal government's employment wage subsidy program, as we met eligible criteria for parts of our media operation…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bce-inc-bce-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q2","e":"bce","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"And in terms of just more general, your point about cost savings with respect to real estate, if I take the real estate question a bit more broadly, clearly with what we've gone through in the last few months, and what we are going to put a strong focus on real estate optimization, and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/bce-inc-bce-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2020-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"On Crave, it continued to deliver, with strong direct-to-consumer growth, 3% year-over-year increase in total subscribers for Crave.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/bce-inc-bce-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCE 2020 Q3","e":"bce","d":"2020-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mirko Bibic","x":"And a couple of other items in the quarter that I wanted to mention, regarding media, to coincide with the fall season of new TV programming, Bell Media 